{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1849","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"D. Array Painting"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You are given an array of $$$n$$$ integers, where each integer is either $$$0$$$, $$$1$$$, or $$$2$$$. Initially, each element of the array is blue."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Your goal is to paint each element of the array red. In order to do so, you can perform operations of two types:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" pay one coin to choose a blue element and paint it red; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" choose a red element which is not equal to $$$0$$$ and a blue element "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"adjacent"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" to it, decrease the chosen red element by $$$1$$$, and paint the chosen blue element red. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"What is the minimum number of coins you have to spend to achieve your goal?"}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains one integer $$$n$$$ ($$$1 \\le n \\le 2 \\cdot 10^5$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line contains $$$n$$$ integers $$$a_1, a_2, \\dots, a_n$$$ ($$$0 \\le a_i \\le 2$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print one integer — the minimum number of coins you have to spend in order to paint all elements red."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n3\n0 2 0\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n1\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n4\n0 0 1 1\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n2\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n7\n0 1 0 0 1 0 2\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n4\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first example, you can paint all elements red with having to spend only one coin as follows:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":true},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" paint the $$$2$$$-nd element red by spending one coin; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" decrease the $$$2$$$-nd element by $$$1$$$ and paint the $$$1$$$-st element red; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" decrease the $$$2$$$-nd element by $$$1$$$ and paint the $$$3$$$-rd element red. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the second example, you can paint all elements red spending only two coins as follows:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":true},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" paint the $$$4$$$-th element red by spending one coin; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" decrease the $$$4$$$-th element by $$$1$$$ and paint the $$$3$$$-rd element red; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" paint the $$$1$$$-st element red by spending one coin; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" decrease the $$$3$$$-rd element by $$$1$$$ and paint the $$$2$$$-nd element red. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"D","problemCode":"1849D","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1849/problem/D"}